1329
02:12:50,646 --> 02:12:54,565
I couldn't see the truth back then.

1330
02:12:55,446 --> 02:12:58,045
The deal you made with Sofia..

1331
02:12:58,766 --> 02:13:01,005
...was in favor of Turks.

1332
02:13:01,966 --> 02:13:04,005
Although you failed to see then

1333
